WEBVTT

00:01.545 --> 00:06.387
FEBRUARY 22, 9:55 PM
YOKOHAMA'S SEVENTH PIER

00:07.097 --> 00:10.103
Right here, tonight,
we will change history.

00:10.939 --> 00:15.823
Gathered here as guests for this event
are Tokyo's top hoodlums.

00:17.326 --> 00:19.497
Shinjuku's Speed Demons.

00:19.581 --> 00:21.209
Kichijoji's SS.

00:21.794 --> 00:23.714
Ikebukuro's ICBM.

00:24.215 --> 00:25.802
Ueno's Night Dust.

00:26.845 --> 00:30.269
And all the other hoodlums
who are confident in their skills.

00:32.314 --> 00:33.483
How disappointing.

00:34.736 --> 00:36.782
You're considered the best now?

00:37.742 --> 00:42.084
This guy Izana Kurokawa, he's a monster.

00:47.929 --> 00:50.100
Crap! I wish I could run.

00:51.436 --> 00:52.438
Izana.

00:52.689 --> 00:53.941
KAKUCHO
TENJIKU'S BIG FOUR

00:54.025 --> 00:55.277
It's past 10 o'clock.

00:56.487 --> 00:57.782
Toman's not coming.

00:59.745 --> 01:00.747
I see.

01:06.090 --> 01:07.510
SHION MADARAME
TENJIKU'S BIG FOUR

01:07.594 --> 01:10.307
We've absorbed their Sixth Division.

01:10.892 --> 01:15.735
I took care of Second Division's Mitsuya
and Fourth Division's Smiley.

01:16.987 --> 01:20.035
We had to go back and make sure
they could never recover...

01:20.118 --> 01:21.120
MOCHIZUKI KANJI
TENJIKU'S BIG FOUR

01:21.204 --> 01:23.793
...because Mochizuki
and the Haitanis are too lenient.

01:24.335 --> 01:27.007
You mean you had your men fight dirty.

01:27.091 --> 01:30.013
Huh? What's wrong with using my men?

01:30.097 --> 01:34.981
Your damn men didn't do enough
to finish Third Division.

01:35.065 --> 01:37.403
Then you handle it yourself!

01:37.486 --> 01:39.991
All you can think to do is fight,
you gorilla.

01:40.075 --> 01:41.995
Huh? What did you call me?

01:42.079 --> 01:43.749
- Cut the crap!
- Huh?

01:52.767 --> 01:53.811
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

01:55.272 --> 01:56.357
Get up!

01:57.109 --> 01:58.445
Get on your feet and walk!

02:00.658 --> 02:01.952
As for First Division,

02:02.537 --> 02:05.918
when Mucho recruited Kokonoi,
he put them out of commission.

02:07.630 --> 02:10.636
You made a wise choice, Kokonoi.

02:12.055 --> 02:14.686
HARUCHIYO SANZU
TENJIKU'S OFFICER, EX-TOMAN MEMBER

02:15.772 --> 02:17.776
And as for Mikey and Draken,

02:18.234 --> 02:19.738
Kisaki took them out.

02:21.324 --> 02:26.459
Right about now,
I bet it feels like a funeral in Toman.

02:26.543 --> 02:29.173
I don't like your methods though.

02:29.674 --> 02:31.427
You hear that, Kisaki?

02:34.726 --> 02:38.107
Izana, Toman's through.

02:41.532 --> 02:42.867
We, members of S-62,

02:43.911 --> 02:46.499
the Vicious Generation,

02:46.583 --> 02:48.712
had a dream that we lost sight of.

02:48.796 --> 02:51.050
But with you and Tenjiku,

02:52.637 --> 02:54.265
we'll make it come true.

02:58.106 --> 02:59.108
Good.

03:10.171 --> 03:11.382
From now on,

03:12.092 --> 03:14.263
we can never lose.

03:19.941 --> 03:21.444
If this is what you want,

03:22.822 --> 03:24.199
then I will stick with you.

03:33.969 --> 03:37.602
Tenjiku will now advance
to a higher stage.

03:38.520 --> 03:43.822
With all the hoodlums of Tokyo,
we will challenge the adult underworld.

03:44.824 --> 03:47.789
Who cares if they're yakuza or whatever.

03:48.916 --> 03:51.755
We'll destroy anyone who defies us

03:52.674 --> 03:56.222
and control the whole underworld of Japan.

03:57.057 --> 04:00.230
And you'll be standing

04:00.815 --> 04:03.904
right in the middle of all that, Mikey.

04:05.616 --> 04:08.956
I'll make sure you suffer bitterly.

04:10.751 --> 04:16.220
That Toman gang, they can't do a thing
without Mikey, can they, Ran?

04:16.303 --> 04:17.598
That's for sure.

04:17.682 --> 04:20.855
But I can't believe
none of them are coming.

04:21.732 --> 04:22.817
No.

04:23.276 --> 04:24.571
He'll come.

04:24.654 --> 04:25.656
Huh?

04:25.740 --> 04:27.367
Who do you mean?

04:27.785 --> 04:28.787
Shh.

04:29.581 --> 04:30.750
Hm.

04:41.479 --> 04:43.483
- Huh?
- Huh?

04:45.529 --> 04:46.865
Whoa! Seriously?

04:47.365 --> 04:50.121
Well, well. They're coming.

04:50.205 --> 04:52.543
Now this is more like it.

04:58.555 --> 04:59.808
It's Toman!

05:00.433 --> 05:02.647
Toman's here!

05:02.730 --> 05:05.653
FIRST GENERATION TOKYO MANJI GANG

05:11.873 --> 05:13.710
Everyone, in position!

06:46.771 --> 06:49.902
TOKYO REVENGERS

07:27.102 --> 07:28.855
I've been waiting for you,

07:29.439 --> 07:30.441
hero.

07:33.197 --> 07:35.869
So that damn Kisaki will watch
from up high.

07:36.328 --> 07:37.957
That's the kind of guy he is.

07:38.040 --> 07:42.591
I guess we can't get to him
unless we destroy Tenjiku first.

07:43.134 --> 07:45.263
What a total weasel.

07:47.058 --> 07:48.102
Kisaki!

07:48.770 --> 07:52.402
I swear I'll drag you down from there!

07:54.991 --> 07:58.330
You're overwhelmingly outnumbered.
What'll you do about it?

07:59.876 --> 08:01.420
This better be entertaining,

08:01.504 --> 08:02.506
Toman.

08:04.342 --> 08:06.388
Let's start with a vanguard fight.

08:06.471 --> 08:07.516
Huh?

08:07.600 --> 08:10.354
That brings back memories.

08:10.438 --> 08:12.150
A vanguard fight, huh?

08:12.233 --> 08:13.485
I like it.

08:13.570 --> 08:16.158
Why don't you leave this to me?

08:16.784 --> 08:18.454
Back down, gorilla.

08:18.538 --> 08:20.584
Huh? Why you bastard, Madarame!

08:20.667 --> 08:23.380
I'll take today's vanguard fight!

08:23.464 --> 08:27.347
Former ninth-generation
BLACK DRAGON leader

08:27.430 --> 08:30.102
and one of Tenjiku's Big Four,
Shion Madarame!

08:30.771 --> 08:32.608
Who are you sending out, Toman?

08:33.108 --> 08:34.319
A vanguard fight?

08:34.946 --> 08:35.948
What's that?

08:36.406 --> 08:39.162
It's a ritual that was popular
with S-62 Generation.

08:39.914 --> 08:43.505
They start with a one-on-one,
that builds up to an all-out battle.

08:43.588 --> 08:45.550
Wow. That's our Gang Dex.

08:45.634 --> 08:46.761
I see.

08:46.844 --> 08:48.055
I bet you have
no big shots left though.

08:48.138 --> 08:52.063
Mikey, Draken, Mitsuya and Smiley.

08:52.146 --> 08:54.735
Not a single central member is left!

08:54.819 --> 08:57.574
Tokyo Manji Gang is just a rabble!

08:57.658 --> 08:58.660
Bastard.

09:00.581 --> 09:01.582
Takemitchy.

09:02.000 --> 09:03.377
For today's battle,

09:04.170 --> 09:06.466
the vanguard has to be me.

09:15.192 --> 09:17.280
You'll be fighting me.

09:17.363 --> 09:18.617
Peh-yan!

09:19.910 --> 09:22.916
Today, you're the acting leader.

09:23.626 --> 09:24.629
Stay back.

09:26.758 --> 09:30.348
Tokyo Manji Gang
Third Division acting captain,

09:30.431 --> 09:33.145
- Ryohei Hayashi...
- Who gives a shit.

09:33.730 --> 09:36.778
I'll kill every last member
of Toman myself.

09:37.613 --> 09:39.867
This vanguard fight is crucial.

09:40.451 --> 09:42.748
Whichever gang wins
will get a morale boost.

09:43.248 --> 09:45.252
- So you realize how important this is?
- Go, Shion!

09:45.336 --> 09:46.673
It's too late now though.

09:47.173 --> 09:49.260
Don't wuss out, Toman!

09:49.344 --> 09:50.889
That sucker's dead meat.

09:51.306 --> 09:55.272
Madarame is Tenjiku's Mad Dog!

09:56.693 --> 09:58.571
You bastards keep yammering...

10:01.034 --> 10:03.957
but you aren't making any sense!

10:11.514 --> 10:12.891
Uh...

10:13.392 --> 10:16.858
Try speaking Japanese, you douches.

10:16.941 --> 10:19.320
No way! What? It's over?

10:19.404 --> 10:21.576
- What?
- What?

10:22.326 --> 10:23.830
Taka once told me,

10:24.456 --> 10:28.005
"Peh-yan may be a moron,
but he's got greater strength than me."

10:28.088 --> 10:29.800
Shion...

10:29.884 --> 10:32.388
That dude took out
one of our Big Four with one punch!

10:32.806 --> 10:34.225
Toman's that good?

10:34.309 --> 10:37.398
I thought we took out
all their best guys already.

10:38.150 --> 10:41.114
Looks like this will be fun, Toman.

10:42.450 --> 10:44.496
- Takemitchy!
- Huh?

10:45.039 --> 10:46.458
The rest is up to you.

10:48.086 --> 10:50.466
You give the signal to attack!

10:54.140 --> 10:55.644
Thank you, Peh-yan.

10:57.438 --> 10:59.735
Okay everybody, you ready?

10:59.818 --> 11:01.029
Yeah.

11:01.112 --> 11:02.323
Anytime.

11:02.406 --> 11:03.701
Okay, Captain.

11:06.541 --> 11:08.085
Izana Kurokawa...

11:08.795 --> 11:11.968
You guys killed my Mikey.

11:13.053 --> 11:15.725
I swear I'll stop you.

11:16.434 --> 11:17.729
And you, Kisaki...

11:24.743 --> 11:27.415
You, I swear, I will never forgive!

11:29.002 --> 11:31.089
Takemichi Hanagaki...

11:31.966 --> 11:33.385
It's been a long battle.

11:33.886 --> 11:35.765
Let's end it right here.

11:37.018 --> 11:40.274
Today, we'll settle the score.

11:44.198 --> 11:47.998
Let's do this!

11:50.670 --> 11:52.591
Take them down!

11:59.730 --> 12:01.149
That hurts!

12:01.232 --> 12:02.736
You okay, Takemitchy?

12:05.784 --> 12:08.831
Out of the way! Out of the way!

12:11.796 --> 12:13.006
Amazing!

12:13.675 --> 12:15.219
He's hitting guys with other guys.

12:16.889 --> 12:17.891
Oh, no!

12:22.526 --> 12:24.697
Keep your head in the game, Takemitchy!

12:24.822 --> 12:25.949
Hakkai!

12:29.247 --> 12:31.585
Takemitchy, you're too far forward!

12:32.002 --> 12:34.257
You're the acting leader,
so we can't lose you!

12:34.340 --> 12:36.512
I know how you feel, Takemichi!

12:36.595 --> 12:40.770
With all these guys,
you don't want to stay at the back!

12:40.854 --> 12:44.152
If Takemichi goes in to fight,
then we'll open the way!

12:47.366 --> 12:48.870
Ow!

12:49.495 --> 12:50.497
You guys...

12:50.915 --> 12:53.170
Takemitchy, follow me!

12:56.050 --> 12:57.512
Akkun! Yamagishi!

12:57.596 --> 12:59.348
Makoto! Takuya!

12:59.432 --> 13:00.476
This way!

13:03.065 --> 13:04.066
Chifuyu!

13:04.150 --> 13:06.446
Though I saw it coming,
we're at a huge disadvantage!

13:06.989 --> 13:08.743
We'll go straight for Kisaki!

13:10.914 --> 13:11.957
He's right.

13:12.041 --> 13:14.253
We're way too far outnumbered.

13:14.838 --> 13:18.721
With things like this,
we probably won't even get to Izana.

13:19.723 --> 13:20.725
In that case...

13:22.729 --> 13:26.862
You make damn sure
you kick that bastard's ass!

13:37.676 --> 13:41.141
Damn it! How the hell did that jerk Kisaki
get all the way up there?

13:43.855 --> 13:46.861
Manjiro Sano and Tetta Kisaki.

13:47.361 --> 13:50.952
The first time I saw him was
in that photo of him in the future.

13:52.371 --> 13:53.624
I've come this far.

13:54.751 --> 13:56.964
At last, I can kick your ass!

13:57.883 --> 14:00.930
Hey there, hero.

14:01.974 --> 14:04.145
I know for sure
you've been time-travelling.

14:04.730 --> 14:08.529
That's why no matter how hard I tried,
the future never changed.

14:09.865 --> 14:11.702
The other time traveller,

14:12.328 --> 14:13.330
Kisaki!

14:14.040 --> 14:16.419
This time I swear I'll kick your ass

14:18.549 --> 14:20.177
and change the future!

14:38.506 --> 14:40.760
You're kicking ass, Toman.

14:42.471 --> 14:44.433
This is what happens when you get cocky.

14:45.227 --> 14:46.229
Shion,

14:47.231 --> 14:50.112
you haven't changed one bit in two years.

14:50.613 --> 14:53.159
Just like when you took over for me

14:53.243 --> 14:58.086
and lost to Mikey and let BLACK DRAGON
get crushed back then.

14:59.046 --> 15:01.927
I don't think
it was because Mikey's strong,

15:02.011 --> 15:04.473
but because you're so damn weak.

15:05.810 --> 15:08.481
If you keep this up,
even Tenjiku will look weak.

15:09.609 --> 15:12.741
I'm acting Third Division captain,

15:12.824 --> 15:15.621
Ryohei Hayashi!

15:15.705 --> 15:18.627
- Crap! What is this guy?
- Is he a beast?

15:18.711 --> 15:20.798
Can't he be stopped?

15:21.215 --> 15:22.844
I'll go fight somebody else.

15:24.138 --> 15:25.600
- Lead...
- Move.

15:30.777 --> 15:31.904
Fight me.

15:38.124 --> 15:40.546
The leader's mine!

15:48.521 --> 15:49.564
Huh?

16:01.420 --> 16:02.422
Good.

16:03.383 --> 16:04.886
That stopped their momentum.

16:07.099 --> 16:10.105
So that's what Izana Kurokawa is like.

17:04.714 --> 17:07.512
The only person who can lead us is you,

17:08.639 --> 17:09.641
Izana.

17:12.605 --> 17:15.987
Someday, let's all get together.

17:17.030 --> 17:18.241
Until then,

17:19.285 --> 17:20.997
become even more vicious.

17:23.877 --> 17:25.005
Okay,

17:25.548 --> 17:27.384
Vicious Generation.

17:27.969 --> 17:29.764
It's your turn.

17:34.189 --> 17:36.152
You there, punk.

17:36.987 --> 17:39.534
You call yourself the acting leader, huh?

17:40.035 --> 17:41.495
This guy!

17:43.499 --> 17:45.504
It's that jerk who first attacked us.

17:46.339 --> 17:49.219
We of the Mizo Mid Squad will fight...

17:49.303 --> 17:52.392
- Hold it right there!
- Huh?

17:57.152 --> 17:58.739
- Chifuyu!
- Chifuyu!

18:00.283 --> 18:02.789
Get up, you meathead gorilla.

18:05.878 --> 18:09.259
You'll be fighting... me.

18:12.642 --> 18:15.146
You in Second Division?

18:17.025 --> 18:19.531
The leftovers again, huh?

18:19.614 --> 18:23.246
How's your captain feeling?

18:23.329 --> 18:24.707
Huh?

18:24.791 --> 18:29.049
I get how tough it is
having an older brother who's famous.

18:29.258 --> 18:30.553
Huh?

18:39.821 --> 18:40.990
Kaku-chan...

18:42.075 --> 18:45.958
I won't let you knock me down
with one punch today, Takemichi.

18:47.920 --> 18:51.636
I've been wanting to face you,
ex-captain of Fifth Division.

18:52.095 --> 18:53.139
Hm.

18:54.475 --> 18:56.187
I'll kill you

18:56.855 --> 18:58.775
and take back Koko.

19:08.085 --> 19:09.087
Koko...

19:12.052 --> 19:14.974
Why the hell did you come here, Takemichi?

19:15.601 --> 19:18.607
- If you hadn't come, you could have...
- Kakucho.

19:18.690 --> 19:19.692
Huh?

19:20.026 --> 19:21.195
Did you know...

19:22.197 --> 19:24.577
that Emma was going to die?

19:28.251 --> 19:29.253
Yeah.

19:31.883 --> 19:32.885
Kaku-chan...

19:33.804 --> 19:37.812
You actually don't want
to be having this war, do you?

19:39.732 --> 19:41.360
Why did you tell me

19:42.028 --> 19:43.740
there was a traitor in Toman?

19:44.283 --> 19:46.788
You want to stop Izana, don't you?

19:47.455 --> 19:49.167
- The Kaku-chan I know...
- Enough.

19:50.336 --> 19:51.673
I've got nothing to say.

19:56.098 --> 19:57.183
All right.

19:58.895 --> 20:02.820
We're going to kick
Izana Kurokawa's ass in this fight.

20:04.657 --> 20:06.911
Then we'll take back Koko,

20:07.454 --> 20:11.546
and I'll settle things with Tetta Kisaki
and crush Tenjiku.

20:12.130 --> 20:13.132
"Settle things"?

20:14.677 --> 20:17.265
Whatever that is,
you've got some serious guts.

20:17.934 --> 20:20.939
But you can't take back Kokonoi.

20:21.023 --> 20:22.025
Huh?

20:22.860 --> 20:25.198
He chose Tenjiku himself.

20:27.452 --> 20:29.749
What's gotten into you, Koko?

20:30.626 --> 20:34.049
You can quit pretending
to be with Tenjiku.

20:34.759 --> 20:36.220
I'm here to take you back.

20:37.807 --> 20:39.978
Toman won't make me any money.

20:42.650 --> 20:44.904
Come join Tenjiku, Inupi.

20:44.987 --> 20:47.910
I've prepared a position for you.

20:48.578 --> 20:50.916
Join us,
and you'll be an officer in no time.

20:52.628 --> 20:54.423
A position? Money?

20:55.676 --> 20:57.220
Grow up, Inupi.

20:57.638 --> 20:59.266
It's clear Toman will lose.

20:59.809 --> 21:01.646
Leave things to me today.

21:02.147 --> 21:03.567
You won't regret it.

21:05.529 --> 21:07.908
Get your hands off me, Koko.

21:09.286 --> 21:11.791
I've put my life into Hanagaki's hands.

21:13.545 --> 21:14.922
BLACK DRAGON too.

21:15.758 --> 21:17.260
I have no intention of joining Tenjiku.

21:17.343 --> 21:19.557
Be wise, Inupi!

21:19.640 --> 21:21.519
Same to you.

21:23.022 --> 21:24.024
Koko,

21:24.107 --> 21:25.819
you don't need money anymore, right?

21:27.197 --> 21:28.867
Just how much longer

21:29.660 --> 21:31.079
will you obsess over Akane?

21:44.481 --> 21:47.738
You're the one who's obsessed.

21:48.322 --> 21:50.619
Rebuild BLACK DRAGON?

21:50.702 --> 21:52.205
But what did you achieve?

21:52.288 --> 21:54.167
You just made it rotten!

21:58.134 --> 21:59.512
I'll accept

22:00.138 --> 22:02.768
that it was me who ruined BLACK DRAGON.

22:03.645 --> 22:06.609
But you've got to accept it too,

22:06.693 --> 22:09.197
that I'm not Akane!

22:09.281 --> 22:11.159
I'm Seishu!

23:43.720 --> 23:45.849
Translated by Brian Athey
